<title>USA: U.S. DAP prices steady-firmer, ammonia steady.</title>
<headline>U.S. DAP prices steady-firmer, ammonia steady.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices for diammonium phosphate (DAP) were steady to firm, with dealers reporting steady demand at the outset of spring planting in the Midwest.</p>
<p>&quot;It looks like it's going to be a high demand year,&quot; said one dealer.</p>
<p>			     Dlrs/short ton	 Chg from Monday</p>
<p>DAP central Fla		175-176		  unc-up 1</p>
<p>DAP central La Gulf	  187-189		  unc-up 2</p>
<p>Ammonia/La Gulf		170			unc</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
